* unemployment / LFP calculations into a macro driven by a parameter list. Here the same idea is  *;
* applied to a reporting macro that takes a demographic dimension, a value, and a label, then      *;
* produces the weighted rates for that subgroup. CPS microdata are an inline weighted-cell sample. *;

